## eLMOS Infrastructure Skills

The repository includes eLMOS Infrastructure Foundation Skills.

1. Start multi-skill work with `$elmos-infrastructure-program-orchestrator`.
2. Read repository-local instructions and discover actual modules before editing.
3. Use stable task IDs from `docs/elmos-infrastructure-foundation/TASK-MATRIX.csv`.
4. Keep PostgreSQL/Temporal/CAS authority boundaries explicit.
5. Do not execute private/untrusted source without identity, tenant authorization, sandbox, egress and secret controls.
6. Prefer compiler/rule transformations before Agent repair.
7. All side effects require idempotency/fencing/reconciliation.
8. Report autonomous system wall-clock runtime separately from human-equivalent effort.
9. Static Skill/package validation is not production proof.
10. Use `$elmos-production-readiness-gate` for any production/commercial claim.
